# Root entry — Tu Pana Writing Studio (bounded preview).
#
# This deployment serves no index.html. The legacy application was retired from
# the preview artifact on 2026-08-08, and a bare 404 at / is not an acceptable
# front door for a writer who typed the bare address. This rule makes / a calm,
# direct entry to the Studio: one hop, no interstitial, no flash of content.
#
# 302, NOT 301. A permanent redirect is cached by browsers indefinitely and
# would be effectively unrecallable from a student's device if the root entry
# ever changes. The root-entry decision stays reversible.
#
# The rule matches / EXACTLY:
#   - existing /studio.html?assignment=... links are untouched;
#   - no retired legacy path is redirected. index.html and start-here.html must
#     return a hard 404 — that 404 is what demonstrates they are retired, and a
#     courtesy redirect would erase the evidence.
#
# Cloudflare Pages consumes this file as deployment configuration; it is not
# served as a path. It is the tenth path in the artifact and the only one that
# is not a served surface. studio_deploy_artifact_test.mjs pins both properties.

/  /studio.html  302
